1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,699
Mana bu — ZAMIN FK stadioni.

2
00:00:02,719 --> 00:00:05,519
Va ulardan birida — sizning ismingiz!

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,073
Har bir obunachi — bitta virtual muxlis.

4
00:00:09,093 --> 00:00:11,053
Stadionda bitta o'rin.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:14,066
Ismingiz — o'z o'rningizda turadi.

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,351
Hozir — bir ming ikki yuz qirq muxlis.

7
00:00:17,371 --> 00:00:19,091
Maqsad — besh ming!

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,034
Besh mingga yetsak — stadionni yangilaymiz va top o'yinchilarni sotib olamiz!

9
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:33,530
Obuna bo'ling va izohga plyus yozing — o'rningiz stadionda abadiy!

